            "fullText": "If you’ve not read Barney Ronayon England 4-2 Croatia, why not read Barney Ronay on England 4-2 Croatia?\n\nEngland played like a Premier League team, but they were more like a Premier League team of the 2000s, all galloping adrenaline, running power, the can’t‑live‑with-it thrusts. This is not in itself a recipe for victory against elite opponents. But the key is that this team has that in its chamber.",
